        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mujiineeda Yerusalemu mii doabiiwaat",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobaloolan gicha ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ea orjeeda siida rukusiina Yerusalemu ng'asheega munyas sina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak giyeeshi gideaba gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Yerusalemu gumdoodaang'u ea heeda ghayi sijiilseey ng'eanyiida Ganaani gil; ak gweanu ea Amori, nea geamadu gaba eemeeda Hiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba iita jeataang'u, eaweeda ghayi sijiilaneey gheapooshtaang'u miyealach nea miyeehhuunyi aba beega. Ak ea miyeewaasaneey balang'da eara gili mwanang', nea miyeekwealseey hang'weaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea manda siida bwaydaneey ak gwasineey ng'asheesu. Nea manda siida bwariinyi eaweeda ghayi sijiilaneey geejakseey jeeda madamnyeanda, aba gideaba eaweeda ghayi sijiilaneey geasinyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Damanda easki murdeadaang'u, ak ghaadaayeeyi nea gidaktakti aba jeeda foojeandaang'u ak geayeeshiineey, earapeadi indi jeeda foojeandaang'u, ‘nyasa eaweega.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasa eaweega ak giheedu uurjeewana geeta mida jeeda madamnyeanda, ak gihissi heeda ea huwa huda, ak gwaheetu gidingaagu nea eara buudeagaagu gwaheetu nea abeeda guwoosi dawiish.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hean iidu nea geasikchi gicha murdeadaang'u ak geang'uleey, ng'ula damandaang'u, abeeda damanda bariinyeega gil, ak geakwealeey aba weeleeda hang'deanyu, ak geadukuti dawiishnataang'u, asaha, geayeakseey habeawooda, ak geasinyi neajeeda sea ang'iing'i ak abeeda guwoosi gatmoodeanyu, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geahuunyeey aba beega, asaha, geahuunyi muuchi foojeandaang'u, ak ghaayeashaneey nagheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geakwealneey hang'da siitaamdaam, nea gealeapneey geeka sisna muunda. Nea geaneawseey weasta hang'deesh miy, ea hang'da miy bumbuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geasinneey suulga aba haleanjeeda suulga, ak ghaayiinyi geatingaagu mulmulanga, nea ghaayiinyi gheataang'u surumga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaayiinyi sareadaang'u ghuniida, nea ghaayiinyi iidigaagu ghuniida, nea ghaayiinyi uhuudaang'u shiipka miyaas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi geataamdaamnyi aba dahaabu was dahaabu, ea lapiya, nea hang'weakaagu ea eashish nea miyaasiin ak ea bumbuni miyaas. Nea sisissa suulga, ak ghwaak dearanga miyaas, ea maleeda, ea nagheeda, nea abeeda ang'iing'i guwoosi miy muuchi, ea uurjeewana sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gageawiit iitaang'u aba jeeda eemoojiga aba leangaagu. Aba gideaba guwoosi doabiiwaat nea gwasin giigheambiiteanyu eagoonyi, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abeeda gighusi leangaagu, ak gisini ng'asheega hiseadayeanduumeeda, aba gidasigwarsiindaneey. Ak gisini hiseadayeanduumeeda aba heeda giliwas sih nyooh ghang'ata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gigeanu hang'weakaagu mwaatkwa ak gigadiyeati sinana heeda daamdaamwaat bea oormoojiga saang'a, amang'ata gisini hiseadayeanduumeeda. Ng'asheanda sunu mii ghanyeadaah ghayi nea maygudu eadaah earahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda gigeanu haleanjeadaang'u miyaas, bea dahaabooda ghayi eagoonyi, ea gea lapiyeedeanyu ghayi eagoonyi amang'ata gisisi geaw sanaamajeega headiga, ak gisini ng'asheega hiseadayeanduumeeda sea saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gigeanu hang'weakaagu miyaasiin bea suulga ak gidukuteawi saawa, amang'ata gigeanu nagheedeanyu ea geedigeasu ng'andidi ak giyiini madeeda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara nagheedeanyu eagoonyi, ea dearanga miyaas, ea maleeda aang'aataawaneey abeeda giyiini madeenyaawa ghoah shearooda ng'andit ea giduurji gil gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gigeanu orjoagaagu ea haweagaagu ghayi ijiilnean, ak giidaydi ghoah lukghumeeda jea eaghwarda aba heeda nyaawa. Heapi? Ng'asheesu ikaagu bea hiseadayeanduumeedean iing'ulay ea ng'asheanda mwanang'? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwak ea nuuseada diibigeasu ak giidawi saawa ghoah lukghumeeda sighwarda aba saawa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba ng'asheagaagu munyas sean, ea ng'asheagaagu bea hiseadayeanduumeadaang'u miipkaadi damandida bea gheareemaneanduumeadaang'uun. Damanda iwaseewi dawiish, nea mindeawani eaghwada, nea gidaktakti aba jeeda foojeandaang'u.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giibinda Yerusalemu gawuurji hiseadayeanduumeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak iing'ata sinoodeaba ng'asheesu seaniin, asi shageada, shageada! Gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gisisi geaw heeda wagiida, nea gisisi geaw heeda wagiida aba gilinyoo ea naweadinga bareanda gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gideasi headaang'u bea wagiida aba ghuusiga naweadinga, nea gihiseadi aba leangaagu. Ak gimealuuli aba gilinyoo ghang'ata, nea giihaadi hiseadayeanduumeadaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gimealuuli sea fuga Misri was giischeewoodigaagu. Fuga bwariiy gasooda haleanjeeda, ak giihaadi ng'asheagaagu bea hiseadayeanduumeeda nea ginung' danyareas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'ula, aba badaydeaba suh, naamiindi geatindeanyu dalasnyi. Ak ea naasuunyi hamitaang'u, ak ea nearuutaneey aba gidagasiida weajoodigaagu, nea haweega fuga Filisti ghabwaspwas aba hiseadayeanduumeadaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea nisini ng'asheega hiseadayeanduumeeda sea fuga Ashuru. Aba gideaba majeamu eelang'uunyi, asaha nisini ng'asheega hiseadayeanduumeeda sea saawa ak ea mii lang'uuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geabwada suh niihaadi ng'asheagaagu bea hiseadayeanduumeeda aba ng'eanyiida Ganaani, ea ghwahita ng'eanyiida fuga Galdayo ak ea miyeelang'uunyi aba suh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gidang'arng'arda gurooroadaang'u gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, inyas gisini ng'asheesu seaniin, gadiyeeda gatmooda hiseada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida bwariiy goombal buuneeda, aba gideaba gideeksi geaw headaang'u haw, aba gilinyo ea uhuuda naweadinga gil. Ak gisini headaang'u bea wagiida aba gilinyoo ea naweeda bareanda nea muwuurjeewani hiseadayda aba gideaba gifooli gideaba giing'waanyi gidageatinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gatmooda hiseada inyeessa ghwadeapta headiga suh nea ghwanung'waada siyeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buuneeda inyeessa ghoadaw gadeemga sean hiseada haleanjeeda guskuseega. Nea ang'iing'i giidawi fugaagu sean ibwariinyi haleanjeadaang'u bea guskuseega, nea giidawi eara seawiischooda aba gideaba gisaawi ak ghapka headaang'u nea gwaleabu meadajeega sean. Aba hiseadayeanduumeadaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba ng'asheagaagu bea hiseadayeanduumeeda ang'iing'i muwuurjeewani gadeemga suurja. Aba gideaba manda dea eadu geeshtaang'u aba ng'asheagaagu bea hiseadayeanduumeeda, nea aba gideaba giidaydi lapiya, mii gideaba geegoonyi lapiya gil. Asi naweadaang'u ea naweadinga nyaawa meateayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ASEETA gaygoorgweaksa Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba ng'asheanji, Ea gatmooda hiseada aleeysiiniit ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ang'iing'i nisaksakti lapiya, ak ea niimwaaldi dawiishnataang'u ak gimealuuli sea fugaagu ibwariinyi, ak ea nibwadi sanaamajeega sean nea giidawi foojeanda diibigaagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'ula gaydabwadageat ng'wasangaagu sean ibwariinyi ghayi ihoosani aba badayda nyaawa, ea gea ibwariinyi sean, ea fuga sean isti. Asaha gaydabwadageat aba badaydaang'u aba meadajeega sean, ak gaydaamwaalda dawiishnataang'u, ak geadaah dawiishnataang'u sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydeargweakseey gawuurji gidasiirgweakiisiinda gadeemga sigeena mealuuli. Ak ghoahiida foojeanda, ak gaydeargweakseey aba foojeanda nyarasta lachng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydayiinyi geatinga nyaawa, ak gaydanung' ghoabeada headaang'u, nea gwanyarja headaang'u bea wagiida, ak saawa gayghafwakta eagweegaagu. Nea gageanda haleanjeadaang'u bea suulga amang'ata gajeenung'useey heeda nea guwoosi dawiish. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeeyeaneey lugooda ak gaygang'eeseey ak gafuteey aba lagheanga ak gwanuusnyi amang'ata ghwalajaadaneey aba ng'utkeaka nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gajeaghwarda gealgaagu aba beasta ak gayghwanung' ghwadaah gadeemga saang'a nyarastaang'u. Ak gajabuuda mealuuleega aba heeda siida wassean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi nih gichea dealang'uuta nyarasteanyu gil aba badaydaang'u, nea gwariteawanean lachng'eanyiidaang'u ak gaydasiinda maygutanyareas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba miipkaadi damanda ghayi bea gheareemaneanduumeadaang'u; ginung' danyareas aba ng'asheesu seaniin, asi ng'ula eara aniini gaydawalda mureandooda aba haleanjeeda sean iisini gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak ea maygut sina hiseadayeanduumeeda dea ng'al ng'asheagaagu munyas seani?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gawuurji gheamata, ak gawuurji huda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sodoma ea Samariya gajeebiikta eadeas",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak gaydaadealda fuga nyaawa ghayi mida ghealooniga, fuga mida ghealooniga bea Sodoma ea haweagaaschi. Ea fuga mida ghealooniga bea Samariya ea haweagaaschi, ea fugaagu mida ghealooniga aba bugusta nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gisareani baspaseegaagu nea gibwaageaw, nea gibwaspwasi, aba ng'asheega sean iisini, aba gideaba nuwoosi hawdeayda aba heeda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea haweega geamadu Sodoma ea haweagaaschi, gaygabiikta gidaghayi bea mwadi nea eara Samariya ea haweagaaschi gaygabiikta gidaghayi bea mwadi nea eara ang'iing'i ea haweagaagu gaygabiikta gidaghayi bea mwadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gifooli huda geamadu was Sodoma aba ghwarjeadaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda miyeetaahajeewa munyindaang'u, gawuurji damandida bwada geat haweega Shaamuun, ea giika sean neaweesean, ea haweega Filisti foolnyi aba meadajeega sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nisareani hiseadayeanduumeadaang'u, ea ng'asheagaagu munyas gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.58"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Neajeeda manda muudeanooda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, gaydasimaneey eara ang'iing'i gidisimi gifooli habeawooda ak ginuusi neajeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydaapkaat neajeadaang'u, ghayi easinyi sea ang'iing'i damanda gheareemaneanduumeadaang'u. Ak gaydeamajeek neajeeda manda muudeanooda sea ang'iing'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.60"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "61",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:61"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gajapkaada naweadingaagu, ak gibwaspwasi, damanda jea deaptaawana haweega geamadu hees, ea gea manang'eewaneey, ak gaydagoonyi suh ghoah haweagaagu, nea mii aba neajeadaang'u gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.16.61",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.16.61"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "62",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 16:62"
          },
          "items": [
            {
