              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydasamseey aba haleanjeeda sean iisini. Ak inyas giipkaadi suh seaniin isiniin gayhamwa ng'eanyi ak gisindi aba baspaseega, ak ea maygut baloola gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA.”",
          "type": "text",
